---
layout: base.njk
title: Premier Driver Improvement Clinic | Online 8 Hour Driver Improvement Clinic
description: Finish your Virginia Driver Improvement requirement online. DMV-approved 8 hour clinic, final exam taken online, electronic certificate emailed on completion. $69.95.
---

{% block head %}
<link rel="preload" as="image" href="/images/hero-student.webp" fetchpriority="high">
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  "name": "Online 8 Hour Driver Improvement Clinic — Premier Driver Improvement Clinic",
  "description": "{{ description }}",
  "url": "{{ site.url }}/",
  "inLanguage": "en",
  "about": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "{{ site.name }}",
    "telephone": "{{ site.phone }}",
    "email": "{{ site.email }}"
  },
  "mainEntity": {
    "@type": "Course",
    "name": "8 Hour Driver Improvement Clinic",
    "description": "Virginia DMV-approved online 8 hour Driver Improvement Clinic for court referrals, point reduction, and insurance savings",
    "provider": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "{{ site.name }}" },
    "offers": { "@type": "Offer", "price": "{{ site.price }}", "priceCurrency": "USD", "availability": "https://schema.org/InStock" },
    "educationalCredentialAwarded": "Electronic Certificate of Completion"
  }
}
</script>
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is this the right course for me?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Most drivers need the 8 Hour Driver Improvement Clinic. It's the standard course for point reduction, license improvement, and most court referrals. It is your responsibility to determine if your court accepts this computer-based driver improvement course to satisfy court required driver improvement courses." }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Do I need to finish the course in one sitting?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Not at all. Work at your own pace — stop and start whenever you like, and your progress saves automatically so the course fits around your schedule. Most students finish over several sessions." }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Which devices does the course work on?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Any of them — phone (iPhone or Android), tablet, laptop, or desktop computer. If you have an internet connection, you're all set." }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is the course approved by the DMV?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. The course is fully approved by the Virginia DMV, so your completion is officially recognized and meets DMV requirements." }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How will I receive my certificate?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Your electronic certificate of completion is issued automatically when you finish and emailed to you right away — no waiting, no extra steps. Download it immediately and submit it to the court or DMV. Your completion of the online driver improvement clinic will be posted to your driving record within 24 hours of the completion date of the course." }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is there a deadline to finish?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "No. Your course link doesn't expire, so take all the time you need." }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is there a final exam?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. The End of Course final test can be taken online, and it's straightforward — every question comes from the course material, so if you work through the lessons, you'll be ready. Open book testing is not permitted. Students may attempt the final exam no more than one time per day." }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What if I'm taking this for a court case?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Many drivers take this course to meet a court requirement. It is your responsibility to determine if your court accepts this computer-based driver improvement course to satisfy court required driver improvement courses." }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Are there any other fees?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "No. The ${{ site.price }} course fee covers everything — the course, the online final exam, your electronic certificate, and reporting your completion to the DMV. Because the final exam is taken online, there are no testing-site fees." }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Can I begin right away?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. You can start the moment you sign up — nothing to schedule and no waiting." }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What if I need help?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Our help desk is available {{ site.helpDeskDays }}, {{ site.helpDeskHours }}. Call {{ site.phone }} or email {{ site.email }}. We're here to keep the process simple and stress-free." }
    }
  ]
}
</script>
{% endblock %}

