        <span>Approved by the Virginia DMV</span>
      </li>
      <li class="hero__check-item slide-in" style="transition-delay: 0.3s">
        <div class="hero__check-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></div>
        <span>Certificate Emailed Instantly</span>
      </li>
      <li class="hero__check-item slide-in" style="transition-delay: 0.45s">
        <div class="hero__check-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></div>
        <span>Begin Right Away</span>
      </li>
      <li class="hero__check-item slide-in" style="transition-delay: 0.6s">
        <div class="hero__check-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></div>
        <span>No Hidden Fees</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="courses" class="section section--courses-overlap" style="padding-top: 120px;">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section__heading fade-in">Your Driver Improvement Course</h2>
    <p class="section__subheading fade-in">One course covers it. The 8 hour clinic handles most traffic tickets, court referrals, and point reduction needs.</p>
    <div class="course-cards course-cards--single">
      <div class="course-card fade-in">
        <span class="course-card__popular">Enrolling Now</span>
        <div class="course-card__pricing">
          <span class="course-card__price">${{ site.price }}</span>
          <span class="course-card__price-note">one-time fee, everything included</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="course-card__title">8 Hour Driver Improvement Clinic</h2>
        <p class="course-card__desc">Fulfills Virginia DMV requirements and is built for point reduction, most traffic violations, court referrals, and insurance savings.</p>
        <ul class="course-card__features">
          <li>End of Course final test taken online</li>
          <li>Electronic certificate of completion emailed to you</li>
          <li>Posted to your driving record within 24 hours of completion</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="course-card__actions">
          <a href="{{ site.enrollUrl }}" class="btn btn--primary">Enroll Now <svg class="btn__arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg></a>
          <a href="/driver-improvement-course/" class="btn btn--ghost">Course Details</a>
        </div>
        <p class="course-card__fineprint">It is your responsibility to determine if your court accepts this computer-based driver improvement course to satisfy court required driver improvement courses.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--dark">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section__heading fade-in">Done in 3 Simple Steps</h2>
    <p class="section__subheading fade-in" style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);">No classroom and no set class times. Everything happens on your timeline.</p>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step fade-in">
        <h3>Enroll Online</h3>
        <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">Register in just a few minutes and get into your course immediately.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step fade-in">
        <h3>Work Through the Course</h3>
        <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">Move through interactive lessons at your own speed on any device, resume right where you stopped, then take the final exam online.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step fade-in">
        <h3>Get Your Certificate</h3>
        <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">Your electronic certificate of completion arrives by email right away, ready for the court or DMV, and your completion is posted to your driving record within 24 hours.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="text-center">
      <a href="#courses" class="btn btn--primary">View the Course <svg class="btn__arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

